{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"ddfc8552-d115-4014-a6ca-3e6f4e336520","status":"SUCCESS","response":"Implemented the analytics events defined in **docs/EVENTS.md** on the registration and offers screens using the existing `Analytics` wrapper.\n\nKey changes:\n- Added `Analytics` import and state flags to ensure events fire only once per screen visit.\n- Captured email/phone start events on first `onChanged`.\n- Moved loan amount analytics to `onChangeEnd` with the selected amount property.\n- Captured terms acceptance once.\n- Wrapped offers list in a `NotificationListener\u003cScrollEndNotification\u003e` to send scroll offset.\n\nFor details on which parts of the colleague’s note were applied, see **ANSWER.md** in the project root.\n","duration_seconds":90.234012,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":23912,"output_tokens":8358,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":270080,"total_tokens":32270}}}
